@LoanApplicationService_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000


### Skapa giltig låneansökan

POST {{LoanApplicationService_Api_HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19920724-0459",
  "amount": 100000
}

